# Web i18n

- Locales: `en`, `fr`, `pt-BR`, `it`, `es` with key parity.
- Persist selection in localStorage; detect browser language on first visit.
- Set `document.documentElement.lang` and send `Accept-Language` on API calls.
- Format numbers with `Intl` APIs, never hardcoded separators.
- When adding a key, update all five locale files in the same change.
